WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.590
In ancient India, one school of thought
set out to count everything that is real.

2
00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.590
It is called Samkhya,
which means counting.

3
00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.990
Its list has 25 basic principles.

4
00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:16.720
Its sister school, yoga, turned
that theory into a practice.

5
00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:20.420
Now think of a moment
when you said: I am angry.

6
00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:23.060
But was the anger really you?

7
00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:27.170
If your thoughts are not your
true self, what is left of you?

8
00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:31.450
In this mission, you'll meet the three
strands that Samkhya says run through all

9
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.560
of nature.

10
00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:36.140
Then you'll find out what
liberation means for Samkhya.

11
00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:40.750
Your mission: find out what Samkhya
says your true self really is.
